      "abstract": "This paper delves into the dialectical relationship between the socio-economic development of ethnic minority and mountainous areas and the goal of strengthening the great national unity bloc in the new era. Based on the theoretical foundations of Marxism-Leninism, Ho Chi Minh's thought, and the latest guiding viewpoints presented in the thematic report by Comrade Bu\u0300i Thi\u0323 Minh Hoa\u0300i, Member of the Politburo, Secretary of the Party Central Committee, and President of the Central Committee of the Vietnam Fatherland Front, the article analyzes the pivotal role of the people, especially ethnic minorities, in the cause of national construction and defense. Using documentary research, synthesis analysis, and international comparison methods, the study clarifies the current situation and achievements after 40 years of Renovation (Doi Moi), while also pointing out the challenges posed by globalization and the Fourth Industrial Revolution. The core of the paper is an analysis of 12 tasks for building social classes and strata and 5 core solutions to realize the viewpoints \"The people are the root\" and \"The people are the masters.\" From this, it proposes sustainable development orientations that ensure fairness and equality for ethnic minority regions, thereby contributing to consolidating trust and the great national unity bloc.",
